wasm grammar equivalence
├── when parsing rust through a wasm grammar
│   └── it matches the native extraction
├── when parsing typescript through a wasm grammar
│   └── it matches the native extraction
├── when a wasm grammar fails to load
│   └── it does not poison other grammars on the thread
├── when two packs share a grammar symbol
│   └── it reports a collision instead of reusing the wrong grammar
└── when two pack sets reuse a symbol in one process
    └── it never serves another modules cached grammar
